Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Sun Nov 1 04:22:26 2026 +0100

    fix(tools): default-import ajv and satisfy lint findings

    ajv 8 exports the class only as its default export, so the named
    import broke typecheck and every suite that links the registry.
    Attach cause to the schema-compile error, flatten the retry
    generator's happy path, and split its member chain.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

